## 4. Non-Keyboard `U+2013` (`0xE2 0x80 0x93`) En-Dashes in `ThatJadenXgamer` Solo Commits

Standard keyboards do not map `U+2013` (`EN DASH`, UTF-8 bytes `0xE2 0x80 0x93`), and IntelliJ IDEA does not convert ASCII `-` (`0x2D`) into `0xE2 0x80 0x93` inside Java comments. Across `Jadens-Nether-Expansion`, `ThatJadenXgamer`'s normal separator is ASCII ` - ` (`101` occurrences). Four `U+2013` lines appear in solo commits authored by `ThatJadenXgamer <[redacted-private-email]>`:

1. **`Jadens-Nether-Expansion` Commit `3d6606a1a784da16059fe2c1814887fb61f46c23` (`2026-06-01`, `PetrifiedSwirlsBlockEntity.java` lines `128` & `137`, live on `1.21.1`):**
   ```java
   // Do NOT save pendingUnpetrify – it would cause premature unpetrification on reload
   // Always reset pending flag on load – never restore from saved data
   ```
2. **`Jadens-Nether-Expansion` Commit `f8ba33139429e7ac82df4952854c47b12255b311` (`2026-03-25`), transferred in `ElysiumAPI` Commit `40c06041fced08e71f3a8a05ed4fc7a49d20ca7d` (`2026-06-27`, `ElysiumArrowItem.java` lines `27` & `29`, live on `1.21.1` and `1.20.1`):**
   ```java
   *   <li>{@code (Level, LivingEntity, ItemStack, ItemStack)} – used when the arrow is shot by an entity
   *       (via {@link #createArrow(Level, ItemStack, LivingEntity, ItemStack)}).</li>
   *   <li>{@code (Level, double, double, double, ItemStack, ItemStack)} – used when the arrow is placed in the world
   *       (via {@link #asProjectile(Level, Position, ItemStack, Direction)}).</li>
   ```

