Both `AsphodelGradle` (`main`) and `ElysiumAPI` (`Asphodel-1.20.1-1.21.1`, `19,101` LOC committed between `2026-10-26` and `2026-11-21`, including `3` commits on `2026-11-21`: `466be53073`, `6351041c81`, `a1306d039e`) have **`0` external contributors** (`100%` committed under `ThatJadenXgamer`).

